    <Note ID="3" FontSize="12.0" Position="1043.1,196.0" Width="267.0">
      <Appearance>
        <Alignment>Left</Alignment>
      </Appearance>
      <String>“I remember. You were close.”
“Would you like to try again?”
“the letter is still here”
“I’ve kept it safe, just as you left it.”
“No need to start again. Unless you wish to.”
“The tide hasn’t touched it. It’s still yours”
““It’s still here, just where you left it. No pressure.”</String>
      <ConnectedNoteIDs>4,42</ConnectedNoteIDs>
      <PointsToNoteIDs>4</PointsToNoteIDs>
    </Note>
